      "text": "On the way back to Asunción, you visit the Pa’i Puku School.\n\nA Belgian missionary founded the school. Around 700 children from across the Chaco study here and learn trades such as carpentry.\n\nIn the evening, you return to Asunción and check in at a 4-star hotel.",
